-term cost-reduction framework with CATL.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/28/nio-inc-nio-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NIO 2019 Q2","e":"nio","d":"2019-09-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Nick Wang","x":"…206.1 million, representing a decrease of 7.9% from the first quarter of 2019, mainly due to the decrease in sales volume caused by electric vehicle subsidiary reduction announced in late March and the slowdown of macroeconomics in China, which has been exacerbated by the U.S.-China trade war.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/01/nio-inc-nio-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NIO 2019 Q2","e":"nio","d":"2019-09-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis Hsieh","x":"These measures primarily focus on increasing efficiencies and streamlining operations within our sales and service network, in our R&D functions as well as reducing our headcount.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/01/nio-inc-nio-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NIO 2019 Q2","e":"nio","d":"2019-09-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis Hsieh","x":"We target to reduce our headcount to around 7,800 by the end of the third quarter from over 9,900 in January 2019, and we expect further headcount reductions by the end of this year through both restructuring and spinning off some business units.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/01/nio-inc-nio-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NIO 2019 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2020-03-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"In response to the micro environment, on one hand, we have actively explored a variety of online channels, including wide streaming platforms, and fully leveraged the well-developed online functions of NIO app to promote online sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/19/nio-inc-nio-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NIO 2019 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2020-03-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"With the supply chain optimization, continuous cost reduction of the battery pack and manufacturing cost saving per vehicle brought forward by production scaling up and management optimization, we have confidence to achieve our goals that our gross margin can turn positive in the second quarter…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/19/nio-inc-nio-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NIO 2019 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2020-03-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"…the supply chain optimization, continuous cost reduction of the battery pack and manufacturing cost saving per vehicle brought forward by production scaling up and management optimization, we have confidence to achieve our goals that our gross margin can turn positive in the second quarter…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/19/nio-inc-nio-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NIO 2020 Q1","e":"nio","d":"2020-05-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"Our current order growth momentum is actually quite strong for the last 30 days because we had the live streaming event and other activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/nio-inc-nio-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NIO 2020 Q1","e":"nio","d":"2020-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"After a series of restructuring and operational optimization initiatives across the company since 2019, our overall efficiency has been significantly improved.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/nio-inc-nio-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NIO 2020 Q1","e":"nio","d":"2020-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stanley Qu","x":"Regarding the first question, in Q1 2020, we have seen expected results from the cost control efforts, including the organization optimiza