18/nio-inc-nio-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2020 Q3","e":"nio","d":"2020-11-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Feng","x":"The decrease in SG&A expenses year over year was primarily driven by the company's overall cost saving efforts and improved operational efficiency in marketing and other supporting functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/18/nio-inc-nio-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2020 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2021-03-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven Feng","x":"And back to numbers, I think the average selling price increase was 10,000 per unit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/nio-inc-nio-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2020 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2021-03-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Feng","x":"The decrease in R&D expenses year over year was caused by the decrease of R&D expenses related to the EC6, which came to mass production in September 2020, and the company's overall cost-saving efforts and improved operational efficiency in R&D functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/nio-inc-nio-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2020 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2021-03-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Feng","x":"The decrease in SG&A expenses year over year was primarily driven by the company's overall cost-savings efforts and improved operational efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/nio-inc-nio-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2021 Q2","e":"nio","d":"2021-08-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"For the export business, our current strategy is that we would like to have a global pricing, but for the specific pricing in different markets, it will vary a little bit considering the tax and the tariffs in different countries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/13/nio-inc-nio-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2021 Q3","e":"nio","d":"2021-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"Affected by the upgrades and the restructuring, we delivered 3,667 vehicles in October.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/nio-inc-nio-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2021 Q3","e":"nio","d":"2021-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"…battery pack. [Foreign language] In terms of production capacity, besides the upgrades and the restructuring of the manufacturing lines in JAC-NIO Advanced Manufacturing Center, the second manufacturing site at NeoPark in Hefei is also under construction. After the kickoff on April 29, we…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/nio-inc-nio-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2021 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2022-03-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"We believe the cost increase or the price hikes is mainly due to the opportunistic price hikes, and there is no specific big gaps in terms of the demand and the supply of the lithium carbonate materials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/25/nio-inc-nio-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2021 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2022-03-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tim Hsiao","x":"The first question is about cost and margin because we know that NIO is better positioned to cope with the battery cost inflation even without price hike.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/25/nio-inc-nio-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2022 Q1","e":"nio","d":"2022-06-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"Regarding the price increases for our products, previously, I have also explained that this is going to be reflected in our vehicle gross margin in the third quarter because right now we are still delivering vehicles without the adjusted price.","