gy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/20/nio-nio-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2024 Q3","e":"nio","d":"2024-11-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stanley Qu","x":"In that case, because of the tariffs, our prices in Europe actually has gone up quite significantly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/20/nio-nio-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2024 Q3","e":"nio","d":"2024-11-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stanley Qu","x":"And the third is continuous cost saving and efficiency improvement initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/20/nio-nio-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2024 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2025-03-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"Regarding the cost reductions, actually since last year we have already started the cost mining initiatives and for the 2024 full year, we were also on track for the cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/21/nio-nio-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2024 Q4","e":"nio","d":"2025-03-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"And we will continue such cost reduction actions this year from multiple aspects, including supply chain, R&D. In that case, we foresee that our vehicle margin will also continue to grow starting Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/21/nio-nio-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2025 Q1","e":"nio","d":"2025-06-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"With that, the actual price increase is around 10%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/nio-nio-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2025 Q1","e":"nio","d":"2025-06-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"For example, automatic pass through of the toll gates on highways.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/nio-nio-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2025 Q1","e":"nio","d":"2025-06-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"On the financial side, the company continued the cost reduction efforts on all fronts, achieving year over year growth in both vehicle gross margin and overall gross margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/nio-nio-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2025 Q1","e":"nio","d":"2025-06-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"We have optimized and restructured the logistics functions, quality functions, and also supply chain functions by streamlining the team and also merging repetitive roles.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/nio-nio-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2025 Q2","e":"nio","d":"2025-09-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Gong","x":"…for example, if you are delivering 20,000 per month with a new self developed chip, what would be the cost saving on the per car basis If this volume is coming to 50,000 per month, what would be the positive impacts from the cost saving angle due to the switching of the self developed chips?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/09/02/nio-nio-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2025 Q3","e":"nio","d":"2025-11-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Xing Chang","x":"So but in the industry is increasing investment in intelligence and also AI-related other areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/nio-nio-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NIO 2025 Q3","e":"nio","d":"2025-11-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William Li","x":"Yet in the meantime, with all the external factors, such as the tariffs in the EU, we also started to realize that for a broader market entrance, we do need to rely on and leverage more on the partner's support and resources.","url":"https://www.foo